VXNlcjEwNTUyNjgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10552683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln","html_url":"https://github.com/barthy-koeln","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-12T23:47:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-12T23:47:13Z","body":"We have implemented a custom JS bridge callback to fill in the gaps. I cannot share code, but here's what we did:\n\n* Create a JavaScript interface attached to the `window` that will activate/deactivate an `input` listener on the existing virtual keyboard HTML elements.\n* Fetch that JavaScript interface with `JavaScriptBridge.get_interface`.\n* Create and store a GDScript callback for JavaScript with `JavaScriptBridge.create_callback`.\n* Pass the GDScript callback to your JS interface, calling it with every `input` event.\n\nThere are a bunch more steps involved to make the thing activate/deactivate with `LineEdit` focus, to change the HTML input's position and size (for autoscrolling), passing properties such as `maxlength` or `autocomplete`, etc …","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3287152515/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]